{"obsah":"<p>After almost 6 years, the organisers of a cycling race for schools and nurseries around Suchdol nad Lužnicí contacted us again. Loads of buses and several hundred kids gathered at the Pískovna campsite, all wanting to grab medals for their school or nursery in individual or team competitions. Part of the programme was an exhibition by Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and Martin Šimůnek, who showed their Trial art in two shows and organised small competitions for volunteers. Long live cycling – hopefully see you next time.</p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FA4939DF4-BAA3-469D-87F9-173C105468A1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2FA4939DF4-BAA3-469D-87F9-173C105468A1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246301\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F3B0DE620-0632-4529-976C-F2EF5D815E74.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F3B0DE620-0632-4529-976C-F2EF5D815E74.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246305\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F5BA70105-10B3-461E-9D8A-133B0536497F.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F5BA70105-10B3-461E-9D8A-133B0536497F.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246304\"/></a></figure